<title>AUSTRALIA: Australian All Ord's hits fresh high at 2,525.4.</title>
<headline>Australian All Ord's hits fresh high at 2,525.4.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian stock market barometer the All Ordinaries index hit a new high of 2,525.4 in Friday afternoon trade, up 20.7 points on Thursday's close.</p>
<p>The previous record of 2,525.2 was hit on Wednesday this week.</p>
